- * mainline bindings; see docs/AUDIO_M6.md for the value-by-value
- * source table and the machine-driver specification.
+ * channel 3 (0x14e70000) plus the Exynos5433 I2S0 controller, and
+ * (milestone 6b) the sound node that binds them through the
