+
+# Timers and scheduler, as exynos_defconfig plus HZ 250.  Without
+# high-resolution timers every timeout was rounded to 10 ms jiffies
+# (uneven frame pacing in Hyprland and Phosh).  SCHED_MC with the
+# board's capacity-dmips-mhz (A53 2048, A57 3575).
+CONFIG_NO_HZ_IDLE=y
+CONFIG_HIGH_RES_TIMERS=y
+CONFIG_HZ_250=y
+CONFIG_PREEMPT=y
+CONFIG_SCHED_MC=y
+# Multi-gen LRU: better reclaim with zram swap (the Omarchy image).
+CONFIG_LRU_GEN=y
+CONFIG_LRU_GEN_ENABLED=y
+# Never write the PMIC RTC from Linux: Android keeps its own reference on it.
+# The RTC is still read at boot; NTP corrects the system time.
+# boot; NTP (systemd-timesyncd over Wi-Fi) corrects the system time.
+# CONFIG_RTC_SYSTOHC is not set
+
+# Milestone 6, audio: I2S0 + WM1814 (driven as WM8998) with the gts28_wm1814
+# machine driver (docs/AUDIO_M6.md).  Everything that probes hardware is a
+# module, loaded by udev after the initramfs watchdog guard.
